#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:4 0cb161c994904c46ab2806b4fa7797ed
msgid "播放控制"
msgstr "Playback control"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:6 5de8355bff0d48e7a53eadc2f68fbebf
msgid "播放器节点管理音频资源和播放通道。低层 ``FmodChannel`` 接口可控制某一次播放的位置、循环和空间属性。"
msgstr ""
"Player nodes manage audio resources and playback channels. The low-level ``FmodChannel`` API "
"controls position, looping, and spatial properties for one playback."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:9 4e214e4ca481495fa0e599af32f9f337
msgid "选择播放节点"
msgstr "Choose a player node"

