msgid "相对 2D 监听器计算距离衰减和左右声像"
msgstr "Distance attenuation and stereo panning relative to the 2D listener"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:20 8d5f70a2d39342c8a7768e71d7afefe4
msgid ":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>`"
msgstr ":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:21 982e115ae6fe4b3a9b02dba590d6cf62
msgid "3D 场景中的位置、方向和距离衰减"
msgstr "Position, direction, and distance attenuation in 3D scenes"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:23 7beef60bb1764760babbbfb337e80810
msgid "将 Stream 赋给节点后调用 ``play()``，或启用 ``auto_play`` 在游戏场景就绪后自动播放。编辑器试听使用 Stream 子检查器中的播放按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Assign a Stream and call ``play()``, or enable ``auto_play`` to start when the game scene is "
"ready. Use the Stream sub-inspector playback button for editor audition."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:26 42323d3572aa4a1ea21f939f29f30cea
msgid "播放、暂停与跳转"
msgstr "Play, pause, and seek"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:28 a03413cbfb2143199e278c98ff56248f
msgid ""
"@onready var player: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = $FmodAudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func play_from(seconds: float) -> void:\n"
"    player.play(seconds)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func pause_audio(paused: bool) -> void:\n"
"    player.stream_paused = paused\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func seek_audio(seconds: float) -> void:\n"
"    player.seek(seconds)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func stop_audio() -> void:\n"
"    player.stop()"
msgstr ""
"@onready var player: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = $FmodAudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func play_from(seconds: float) -> void:\n"
"    player.play(seconds)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func pause_audio(paused: bool) -> void:\n"
"    player.stream_paused = paused\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func seek_audio(seconds: float) -> void:\n"
"    player.seek(seconds)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func stop_audio() -> void:\n"
"    player.stop()"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:48 cebde1cab40b48f59a9dc3a7d2a40a27
msgid ""
"节点的 ``play()``、``seek()`` 和 ``get_playback_position()`` 使用秒。暂停期间 ``is_playing()`` 仍可返回 "
"``true``；暂停状态通过 ``stream_paused`` 判断。"
msgstr ""
"Node ``play()``, ``seek()``, and ``get_playback_position()`` use seconds. ``is_playing()`` may "
"remain ``true`` while paused; check ``stream_paused`` for pause state."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:51 872af93d055b414ba98345134d15f7bb
msgid "音量、音高与淡变"
msgstr "Volume, pitch, and fades"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:53 9817fc55b85849bfb0ca7ba74342731b
msgid "节点使用 ``volume_db`` 调整分贝音量，使用 ``pitch_scale`` 调整音高和速度。``0.0`` dB 和 ``1.0`` 倍分别表示单位增益和原速。"
msgstr ""
"Nodes use ``volume_db`` for volume in decibels and ``pitch_scale`` for pitch and speed. ``0.0`` "
"dB is unity gain and a multiplier of ``1.0`` is normal speed."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:55 c069177014d040c081a5b876d3d4ed74
msgid ""
"func fade_player(player: FmodAudioStreamPlayer, target_db: float, duration: float) -> void:\n"
"    var tween: Tween = create_tween()\n"
"    tween.tween_property(player, \"volume_db\", target_db, duration)"
msgstr ""
"func fade_player(player: FmodAudioStreamPlayer, target_db: float, duration: float) -> void:\n"
"    var tween: Tween = create_tween()\n"
"    tween.tween_property(player, \"volume_db\", target_db, duration)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:62 e1300a6bbd364012a25dd230d768410f
msgid "循环与重叠播放"
msgstr "Looping and overlapping playback"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:64 5573661a130b4e65a4a1d063d1dda299
msgid ""
"循环在资源的 ``mode_flags`` 中配置，见 :doc:`audio_resources`。对同一个节点再次调用 ``play()`` "
"会重新开始当前播放；同时发出多个声音时，使用多个节点或独立通道。"
msgstr ""
"Configure looping with the resource ``mode_flags``; see :doc:`audio_resources`. Calling "
"``play()`` again on one node restarts its playback. Use separate nodes or channels for "
"overlapping sounds."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:66 54eccd4ddf3a46bfae0b90ac7dae2e1a
msgid ""
"func play_one_shot(audio: FmodAudioStream) -> void:\n"
"    if audio == null:\n"
"        return\n"
"    var player: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = FmodAudioStreamPlayer.new()\n"
"    player.stream = audio\n"
"    player.finished.connect(player.queue_free, CONNECT_ONE_SHOT)\n"
"    add_child(player)\n"
"    player.play()"
msgstr ""
"func play_one_shot(audio: FmodAudioStream) -> void:\n"
"    if audio == null:\n"
"        return\n"
"    var player: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = FmodAudioStreamPlayer.new()\n"
"    player.stream = audio\n"
"    player.finished.connect(player.queue_free, CONNECT_ONE_SHOT)\n"
"    add_child(player)\n"
"    player.play()"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:77 bad2f2e88e1a42bd9e3feafdf7415911
msgid "此示例使用非循环音频，自然结束时释放临时节点。主动调用 ``stop()`` 不会触发 ``finished``，主动停止时也要安排节点回收。高频音效可复用播放器池。"
msgstr ""
"Use non-looping audio in this example; natural completion frees the temporary node. Calling "
"``stop()`` does not emit ``finished``, so arrange cleanup when stopping manually. Reuse a player "
"pool for frequent effects."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:80 b653697f82934361914fa6bd94b6299e
msgid "2D 与 3D 位置音频"
msgstr "Positional audio in 2D and 3D"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:82 38b268adfc45404594ff7296e2dd5e7a
msgid "将空间播放器放在声源节点下，使其随角色、车辆或环境物件移动。服务器在游戏中读取当前视口相机作为监听器；编辑器试听使用编辑器相机。"
msgstr ""
"Parent a spatial player to its emitter so it follows a character, vehicle, or environment object."
" The server uses the current viewport camera as the game listener and the editor camera during "
"editor audition."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:84 75fa083d30a548578b26460f1676bbe5
msgid ""
"2D 调整 ``max_distance``、``attenuation`` 和 ``panning_strength``；3D 调整距离与衰减模型，并确认当前 Camera3D "
"已激活。检查声源和监听器的世界坐标及方向。"
msgstr ""
"In 2D, adjust ``max_distance``, ``attenuation``, and ``panning_strength``. In 3D, configure "
"distance and attenuation, and activate the intended Camera3D. Check emitter and listener world "
"positions and orientation."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:87 5625a5d9acae45989d5a85944eef82ef
msgid "低层通道播放"
msgstr "Low-level channel playback"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:89 6f3ce20bed3840bfafc44858c4f64e28
msgid "``FmodSystem.play_sound()`` 返回本次播放的 ``FmodChannel``。以下函数接收由调用方保留的 ``FmodSound``，先暂停创建通道，设置参数后恢复播放："
msgstr ""
"``FmodSystem.play_sound()`` returns a ``FmodChannel`` for that playback. This function accepts a "
"``FmodSound`` retained by its caller, creates a paused channel, configures it, and resumes:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:91 70dba39cfb2342698f0f09816de3a10b
msgid ""
"func play_sound(sound: FmodSound, bus_name: StringName = &\"Master\") -> FmodChannel:\n"
"    var bus: FmodAudioBus = FmodServer.get_audio_bus(bus_name)\n"
"    var group: FmodChannelGroup = bus.get_bus() if bus != null else "
"FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"    var channel: FmodChannel = FmodServer.get_main_system().play_sound(sound, group, true)\n"
"    if channel == null:\n"
"        return null\n"
"    channel.volume_db = -6.0\n"
"    channel.pitch = 1.0\n"
"    channel.set_paused(false)\n"
"    return channel"
msgstr ""
"func play_sound(sound: FmodSound, bus_name: StringName = &\"Master\") -> FmodChannel:\n"
"    var bus: FmodAudioBus = FmodServer.get_audio_bus(bus_name)\n"
"    var group: FmodChannelGroup = bus.get_bus() if bus != null else "
"FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"    var channel: FmodChannel = FmodServer.get_main_system().play_sound(sound, group, true)\n"
"    if channel == null:\n"
"        return null\n"
"    channel.volume_db = -6.0\n"
"    channel.pitch = 1.0\n"
"    channel.set_paused(false)\n"
"    return channel"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:104 fc900516b4694554a41f5622d10d09f1
msgid "低层通道使用 ``pitch``；播放器节点使用 ``pitch_scale``。通道位置默认以毫秒表示，也可通过 ``FmodSystem.FmodTimeUnit`` 指定其他单位："
msgstr ""
"Low-level channels use ``pitch``; player nodes use ``pitch_scale``. Channel positions default to "
"milliseconds; select other units with ``FmodSystem.FmodTimeUnit``:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:106 2623528907994c86abb2e20a7f7deff4
msgid ""
"func seek_channel(channel: FmodChannel, seconds: float) -> void:\n"
"    channel.set_position(int(seconds * 1000.0), FmodSystem.FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS)"
msgstr ""
"func seek_channel(channel: FmodChannel, seconds: float) -> void:\n"
"    channel.set_position(int(seconds * 1000.0), FmodSystem.FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:111 5a4d997d35ae4f46a14aa9b438ca9222
msgid "运行时总线和效果配置见 :doc:`mixer`、:doc:`dsp_effects`。无声、首次播放延迟及资源清理问题见 :doc:`faq`。"
msgstr ""
"See :doc:`mixer` and :doc:`dsp_effects` for bus and effect configuration. For silent playback, "
"first-play latency, and resource cleanup, see :doc:`faq`."
